    "Unknown or incomplete evidence returns Indeterminate.",
    "Recipient consent is beneficiary-authored under BilateralOwnerClaimV1.",
    "A forked predecessor has no DHT-order winner and remains non-spendable.",
    "Duplicate remote delivery is at-least-once transport with at-most-once economic effect."
  ],
  "scenarios": [
